# Scenario 'tutorial_profile': boot from the state left by 'register' (adapter registered, SRAM mid first-run).
# Title screen -> first-run tutorial pages (about 80 A presses; every tutorial page is dismissed with A) ->
# nickname keyboard ("プロフィール ニックネーム") -> mail menu -> send/receive mail over the fake Internet
# (dial, PPP, DNS, POP3 STAT, disconnect) -> communication result screen.
# (Tutorial pages can also be skipped with SELECT="おわる"; this scenario deliberately reads all of them.)
wait 400                     # power-on logo + adapter check (adapter is registered so no registration flow)
waitstable 60 max 600
shot gb_logo_or_title
gap 30
tap A                        # title "スタート"
waitstable 60 max 600
shot title_or_first_page
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 30 max 200
tap A
waitstable 30 max 200
